  <p id="c-nanqishu-040-zizhen-shaoling:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">邵陵王<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zizhen-shaoling:p001:m0003" ref="kix_r92_2ed_F">子貞</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zizhen-shaoling:p001:m0006" ref="kix_r92_2ed_F">雲松</persName>，世祖第十四子也。永明十年，爲東中郎將、吳郡太守。鬱林卽位，進號征虜將軍，還爲後將軍。建武二年，見誅。年十五。</p>
</text>
